    <summary>Honest, Privacy-First Desktop Disk Analyzer and Storage Management Hub</summary>
    <description>
CleanPilot is an open, honest, zero-telemetry Windows storage analyzer, duplicate hunter, and system health hub.
Built with Java 21 Virtual Threads, Spring Boot 3, JavaFX 21, and OSHI.

### Features
- Memory-bounded streaming duplicate detection (NIO.2 Direct ByteBuffer SHA-256)
- Developer cache hunter (node_modules, .gradle/caches, target, .venv)
- Rogue process &amp; crypto-miner threat hunter
- Laptop battery degradation, thermal throttling, and SMART drive health
- Safe native recycle bin restoration support
- 100% offline, zero network telemetry, zero cloud dependencies
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/cleanpilot/cleanpilot/releases/tag/v1.0.0</releaseNotes>
